{"id":"71482988da2fa4ef","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-order10-supremum-closed-subset.md","title":"ZFC Order10 Supremum Closed Subset","display":"df-zfc-order10-supremum-closed-subset — ZFC Order10 Supremum Closed Subset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order10-supremum-closed-subset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order10-supremum-closed-subset"],"display":"df-zfc-order10-supremum-closed-subset — ZFC Order10 Supremum Closed Subset","depends_on":["[[58-df-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order10-supremum-closed-subset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order10-supremum-closed-subset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order10-supremum-closed-subset — ZFC Order10 Supremum Closed Subset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,C\\in V\">\\(P,C\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P^2\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Order}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Order}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10SupremumClosedSubset}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10SupremumClosedSubset}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}supremum\\text{-}closed\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder10SupremumClosedSubset}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Order}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land C\\subseteq P\\land\\forall D\\subseteq C\\;\\forall s\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\\bigl(\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq_P s)\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;((\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq_P u))\\to s\\leq_P u)\\bigr)\\to s\\in C\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}supremum\\text{-}closed\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder10SupremumClosedSubset}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Order}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land C\\subseteq P\\land\\forall D\\subseteq C\\;\\forall s\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\\bigl(\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq_P s)\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;((\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq_P u))\\to s\\leq_P u)\\bigr)\\to s\\in C\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient order is an explicit argument because the supremum and hence closure depend on it.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-order","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Order}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P\\subseteq P^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Order}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10SupremumClosedSubset}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}supremum\\text{-}closed\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder10SupremumClosedSubset}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Order}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land C\\subseteq P\\land\\forall D\\subseteq C\\;\\forall s\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\\bigl(\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq_P s)\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;((\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq_P u))\\to s\\leq_P u)\\bigr)\\to s\\in C\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1079,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2875","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-order10-supremum-closed-subset.md|58-df-zfc-order10-supremum-closed-subset]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["2aa29158e60b337f"]}